==English==

===Etymology===
{{root|en|ine-pro|*per- (fare)}}
From {{inh|en|enm|reporten}}, from {{der|en|xno|reporter}}, {{der|en|frm|reporter}}, and their source, {{der|en|la|reportāre||to carry back, return, remit, refer}}, from {{m|la|re-}} + {{m|la|portare|portāre}}.

